sequenceDiagram
 actor User
 participant App as Application gateway
 participant Store as SQLite ownership and history
 participant Sup as Agent supervisor
 participant Router as Inference router
 participant Broker as Tool broker
 User->>App: Start or Continue work
 App->>Store: Validate plan, holds and expected revisions
 alt Planning is incomplete
  App-->>User: Candidate plan and approval/input request
 else Work is eligible
  App->>Store: Record owner and activation intent
  Store-->>Sup: Durable dispatch
  Sup->>Store: Reserve root work subagent slots
  par Independent ready task A
   Sup->>Router: Scoped session request
   Router-->>Sup: Ordered response and tool call
   Sup->>Broker: Durable permitted tool intent
   Broker-->>Sup: Observed result or uncertainty
  and Independent ready task B
   Sup->>Store: Another assignment within root allowance
  end
  Sup->>Store: Evidence, checkpoints and next state
  Store-->>User: Incremental inspectable work state
 end
